---
layout: base.njk
title: Young Writer’s Workshop
description: The Herbart Kita Young Writer’s Workshop, including coaching for the Harvard International Review Academic Writing Contest, Fall/Winter cycle.
permalink: /workshop/
---
{% from "macros.njk" import fill %}
{% set ws = programs.workshop %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker"><a href="/programs/">Programs</a> · Young Writer’s Workshop</p>
    <h1 class="display display--page">Coaching for young writers.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The Young Writer’s Workshop is Herbart Kita’s writing program for students. It includes coaching for the Harvard International Review Academic Writing Contest.</p>
    <dl class="tally tally--text">
      <div><dt>Dates</dt><dd>{{ fill(ws.dates) }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Format</dt><dd>{{ fill(ws.format) }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Tuition</dt><dd>{{ fill(ws.tuition) }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="hir">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-label">HIR Academic Writing Contest coaching</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>We coach students through the Fall/Winter cycle of the Harvard International Review Academic Writing Contest, up to the submission deadline and Defense Day.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="tally tally--text">
      <div><dt>Submission deadline</dt><dd>Jan 2, 2027</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Defense Day</dt><dd>Feb 5, 2027</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Divisions</dt><dd>Junior: grades 7–8<br>Senior: grades 9–12</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="disclaimer">The HIR Academic Writing Contest is an independent contest. Herbart Kita is not affiliated with the Harvard International Review (HIR).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <h2 class="section-label">Prize scholarship</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>One of the <a href="/prize/#awards">Young Writers Prize</a> awards is a scholarship to the Workshop.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="apply">
  <div class="wrap cta">
    <div>
      <h2 class="cta__title">How to apply</h2>
      <p>Applications: {{ fill(ws.howToApply) }}</p>
      {% if site.email %}<p>Questions: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Young%20Writer%E2%80%99s%20Workshop">{{ site.email }}</a></p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
